NOTE ON CONTENT

This license covers the BitGoose source code only.

BitGoose reads and links to journalism published by third parties. It does not
redistribute their text: source material is stored privately for analysis and
is never served. Published output is original synthesis with attribution and a
link to every source it drew on. Copyright in the linked articles remains with
their respective publishers.
